"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkblog||=[]).push([[518],{4369(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"enchanted-by-serverhive","metadata":{"permalink":"/enchanted-by-serverhive","source":"@site/blog/2026-11-04-enchanted-by-serverhive/index.mdx","title":"Enchanted by ServerHive","description":"Enchanted by ServerHive","date":"2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":false,"label":"Announcement","permalink":"/tags/announcement","description":"General announcements from the Halcyon Project."},{"inline":false,"label":"Infrastructure","permalink":"/tags/infrastructure","description":"Infrastructure and build server updates."},{"inline":false,"label":"ServerHive","permalink":"/tags/serverhive","description":"ServerHive sponsorship and program announcements."},{"inline":false,"label":"Open Source","permalink":"/tags/open-source","description":"Open-source community initiatives and programs."}],"readingTime":0.9,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Alif Fathur (herobuxx)","title":"Lead Developer","url":"https://github.com/herobuxx","page":{"permalink":"/authors/herobuxx"},"key":"herobuxx"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"enchanted-by-serverhive","title":"Enchanted by ServerHive","authors":["herobuxx"],"tags":["announcement","infrastructure","serverhive","open-source"],"image":"./banner.jpg"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"A New Home & A Fresh Bloom \u2013 Halcyon 17 Calla Lily","permalink":"/welcome-and-halcyon-17-calla-lily"}},"content":"![Enchanted by ServerHive](./banner.jpg)\\n\\nWe are glad to share that **Halcyon** has been selected as a grant recipient for the **ServerHive Open Source Support Program (Season 2)**.\\n\\nThrough this program, ServerHive is providing us with compute infrastructure to help power our ongoing development.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n### Supporting the Open-Source Ecosystem\\n\\nRunning an open-source Android project requires significant resources, and initiatives like the ServerHive OSS Support Program play a vital role in helping independent teams bring their ideas to life. By providing compute capacity to projects across the custom ROM and Android community, ServerHive is actively helping developers build, maintain, and innovate.\\n\\nWe\u2019re really excited to have ServerHive backing us for this season. Huge thanks to their team for creating this program and stepping up to support open-source Android development.\\n\\nIf you are looking for fast, reliable, and affordable build servers tailored for developers, check out their official links below:\\n\\n* **Instant Purchases:** [@ServerHive_Bot](https://t.me/ServerHive_Bot)\\n* **Support:** [@ServerHiveSupport_bot](https://t.me/ServerHiveSupport_bot)\\n* **Updates & Announcement Channel:** [@ServerHive](https://t.me/ServerHive)\\n* **OSS Program:** [ServerHive GitHub Repository](https://github.com/ServerHive-Development/oss-program)"},{"id":"welcome-and-halcyon-17-calla-lily","metadata":{"permalink":"/welcome-and-halcyon-17-calla-lily","source":"@site/blog/2026-10-24-a-fresh-bloom-halcyon-17-calla-lily/index.mdx","title":"A New Home & A Fresh Bloom \u2013 Halcyon 17 Calla Lily","description":"Halcyon 17 Calla Lily","date":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":false,"label":"Announcement","permalink":"/tags/announcement","description":"General announcements from the Halcyon Project."},{"inline":false,"label":"Calla Lily","permalink":"/tags/calla","description":"Updates and releases for Halcyon 17 Calla Lily."}],"readingTime":1.5,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Alif Fathur (herobuxx)","title":"Lead Developer","url":"https://github.com/herobuxx","page":{"permalink":"/authors/herobuxx"},"key":"herobuxx"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"welcome-and-halcyon-17-calla-lily","title":"A New Home & A Fresh Bloom \u2013 Halcyon 17 Calla Lily","authors":["herobuxx"],"tags":["announcement","calla"],"image":"./banner.jpg"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Enchanted by ServerHive","permalink":"/enchanted-by-serverhive"}},"content":"![Halcyon 17 Calla Lily](./banner.jpg)\\n\\nWelcome to the official Halcyon blog! We are thrilled to launch this space as a central hub where we will share news, update logs, and insights into the development of Halcyon.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nAlong with opening this blog, we are excited to officially announce **Halcyon 17**, codenamed **Calla Lily**.\\n\\n## Special Thanks\\n\\nReaching this milestone would not have been possible without the dedication and hard work of several key contributors.\\n\\nWe would like to extend our sincere thanks to:\\n\\n* **Raya (rktdnt)** for taking the initiative to lead the source code bringup.\\n* **Binzet** and **Naoko Shoto** for creating stunning wallpapers and design assets.\\n* **Eren** for generously covering our hosting infrastructure.\\n* **neroices** for building and designing our new website.\\n* Everyone who signed up for our **Closed Beta Test**. Your enthusiasm and early feedback mean a lot to us.\\n\\n## What is Coming Next?\\n\\nWe are currently preparing for the upcoming **Public Beta** release.\\n\\nHere is a quick look at what you can expect:\\n\\n* **Feature Parity:** Most of your favorite features from Halcyon 16.2 have already been ported over, and any remaining ones will be added soon.\\n* **Refreshed UI:** We have given the user interface a subtle refresh for a cleaner and smoother experience.\\n* **More to Come:** Additional customization and system enhancements are actively in development.\\n\\n## Source Code & Building\\n\\nFor developers, maintainers, and enthusiasts looking to dive in, the source code for **Halcyon 17** is now available and buildable!\\n\\nIf you would like to compile Halcyon for your device or start bringing up a new tree, please refer to our [Wiki](https://wiki.hlcyn.org) for complete guides on syncing the manifest, setting up your build environment, and compiling the source.\\n\\nStay tuned to this blog for future announcement posts, changelogs, and release schedules. Thank you for being part of the Halcyon community!"}]}}')}}]);